{"format":1,"manifest":{"name":"justfile","publisher":"vyloxi","version":"1.0.0","displayName":"Just","description":"Syntax coloring, comment toggling and snippets for Just (.just).","engines":{"ferrum":"^0.1.0"},"categories":["Languages"],"icon":"icon.png","repository":"https://github.com/voukengdongmofrankysteve/ferrum-market","license":"MIT","contributes":{"languages":[{"id":"justfile","name":"Just","extensions":[".just"],"grammar":"grammars/justfile.json","filenames":["justfile","Justfile",".justfile"],"lineComment":"#"}],"snippets":[{"language":"Just","path":"snippets/justfile.json"}]}},"files":{"icon.png":{"encoding":"base64","content":""},"grammars/justfile.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"ignoreCase\": false,\n  \"rules\": [\n    {\n      \"match\": \"#.*$\",\n      \"token\": \"comment\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\"(?:[^\\\"\\\\\\\\]|\\\\\\\\.)*\\\"\",\n      \"token\": \"string\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"'(?:[^'\\\\\\\\]|\\\\\\\\.)*'\",\n      \"token\": \"string\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"^@?[A-Za-z_][\\\\w-]*(?=[^:=\\\\n]*:(?!=))\",\n      \"token\": \"function\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\{\\\\{[^}]*\\\\}\\\\}\",\n      \"token\": \"macro\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"^[A-Za-z_][\\\\w-]*(?=\\\\s*:?=)\",\n      \"token\": \"property\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"`[^`]*`\",\n      \"token\": \"string\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"^\\\\s+@\",\n      \"token\": \"keyword\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:0[xX][0-9a-fA-F_]+|0[bB][01_]+|0[oO][0-7_]+|\\\\d[\\\\d_]*(?:\\\\.\\\\d[\\\\d_]*)?(?:[eE][+-]?\\\\d+)?)[uUlLfFdDnNiI]{0,3}\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"number\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:unexport|export|import|assert|alias|else|set|mod|if)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"keyword\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:false|true)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"constant\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n"},"snippets/justfile.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"Recipe\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"rec\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"${1:build}:\",\n      \"    ${2:echo \\\"building\\\"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A recipe\"\n  },\n  \"Recipe with argument\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"recarg\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"${1:run} ${2:arg}:\",\n      \"    echo {{${2:arg}}}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A recipe with an argument\"\n  },\n  \"Default recipe\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"default\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"default:\",\n      \"    @just --list\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"The default recipe\"\n  },\n  \"Variable\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"var\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"${1:name} := \\\"${2:value}\\\"\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A variable\"\n  }\n}\n"},"README.md":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"# Just\n\nSyntax coloring, comment toggling and snippets for Just.\n\n## Files\n\n`.just`, `justfile`, `Justfile`, `.justfile`\n\n## Features\n\n- Colors keywords, types, strings, numbers, comments and more. The colors follow your theme.\n- **Toggle Line Comment** (Ctrl+/) uses `#`.\n- 4 snippets.\n\n## Snippets\n\nType the prefix and press Tab.\n\n| Prefix | What it inserts |\n| --- | --- |\n| `rec` | A recipe |\n| `recarg` | A recipe with an argument |\n| `default` | The default recipe |\n| `var` | A variable |\n\nThis extension runs no code and asks for no permissions. It is built with the [language contribution](https://ferrum.vyloxi.com/docs/languages) format.\n"}}}